<title>SINGAPORE: Transpac first-half net at S$5.55 mln.</title>
<headline>Transpac first-half net at S$5.55 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    5.55    vs    0.21</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	     13.88    vs    0.52</p>
<p>    Investment and other income     7.67    vs    2.29</p>
<p>    Pre-tax				 5.55    vs    0.57</p>
<p>    Tax				     nil     vs    0.36</p>
<p>Note - Transpac Industrial Holdings Ltd said since June 30, it made two new investments totalling S$5.30 million with four investments approved and pending completion. It expects funds will be fully invested by 1997.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
